&lt;p style="margin-left: 90px; line-height: 1; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp030000-asr_E04358-000:NotesRegardingLossOnSalesOfOtherInvestmentsTextBlock>
